# UI Consistency Standard (MANDATORY)

Full text: `.agents/rules/ui-consistency-standard.md`. Run `php tests/UiConsistencyTest.php` after any view/JS change.

- Content inside one `<div class="page-list">` (fullBleed tools excepted). Title/breadcrumb come from the layout: no own `<h1>`.
- Page actions only in `header_actions`, right aligned, secondary first, primary last. Card title = `h2.card-title`.
- Primary action = `btn btn-wa` (`btn-sm` in header and table rows); secondary/cancel = `btn-outline-secondary`; destructive = `btn-outline-danger` + `APP.confirm`/`APP.deleteConfirm`.
- Never `btn-primary`, `btn-success`, `btn-info`, `btn-dark`, `btn-outline-primary` for actions.
- Feedback only via `APP.toast`; confirmations only via `APP.confirm`. Never native `alert()`/`confirm()`/`prompt()`.
- Reuse `partials/status_badge`, `partials/empty_state`, `partials/alerts`; shared JS goes in `APP.*`.
- All UI text English.
